Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:11.78,End,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}EPISODE 09\N{\c&H00D6FF&}LUC'S ONE MINUTE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:09.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow, big Zino! Tai Chi Jet Li Zino!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.37,0:00:15.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grand Chuckuchucku Zino! Please, talk to that girl for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:20.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? The other day you were Fon Echikie and Jean Lambert on commentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:22.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,All that mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:27.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it's match commentary, Gideon turns into Martin Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.43,0:00:32.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only say what I see, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:35.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did you see how the third bottle fell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:40.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I saw it. Zino almost broke that bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.82,0:00:56.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next time, don't talk so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.99,0:00:59.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next time, use your own mouth first.
